cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "research-skills: agent skills for writing machine learning papers"
message: "If these skills help your paper, please cite this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Skoutnev
    given-names: Alexy
repository-code: "https://github.com/Alexyskoutnev/research-skills"
abstract: >-
  Ten agent skills covering the writing of a machine learning paper, from
  abstract to rebuttal. Each skill pairs a recipe and a set of documented
  judgment calls with a mechanical checklist an agent runs before the section
  ships. The skills are plain Markdown and load in any agent that reads a
  SKILL.md file.
keywords:
  - agent-skills
  - claude-code
  - academic-writing
  - scientific-writing
  - paper-writing
  - machine-learning
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-06"
